</section></score></mdiv></body>
<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>O glorious Savior, Thee I praise;</l><l>To Thee my new glad song I raise,</l><l>And tell of what Thou art.</l><l>Thy grace is boundless in its store;</l><l>Thy face of love shines evermore;</l><l>Thou givest me Thy heart.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>Upon Thy promises I stand,</l><l>Trusting in Thee: Thine own right hand</l><l>Doth keep and comfort me;</l><l>My soul doth triumph in Thy word;</l><l>Thine, Thine be all the praise, dear Lord,</l><l>As Thine the victory.</l></lg>
<lg label="4."><l>Love perfecteth what it begins;</l><l>Thy power doth save me from my sins;</l><l>Thy grace upholdeth me.</l><l>This life of trust, how glad, how sweet;</l><l>My need and Thy great fulness meet,</l><l>And I have all in Thee.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
